title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: erc_fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: erc_fundraising_timer = 12; month_actions += 1
is-card: true
card-image: img/erc/executiva.jpg
face-image: img/erc/executiva.jpg
tags: erc_party
role: card-party

= Fundraising

Fact is, the party needs resources to work. [? if party_income < 2: Right now, the vast majority of our funding comes from public subsidies, which are dependant on our electoral results. ?][? if party_income > 2: Despite a part of our funding still coming from public subsidies, our recent party affiliation rates hike means we are less dependant on those than what we used to be. ?] We can, of course, move to change the structure of this funding.

- @higher_allocation
- @lower_allocation
- @raise_rates
- @lower_rates
- @return: We do not need to change our funding sources.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@higher_allocation
title: Lobby for an increase of party subsidies
choose-if: party_resources_mult <=3 and erc_left_strength < 30
unavailable-subtitle: [? if party_resources_mult > 3: Party subsidies are already as high as they can reasonably be. ?][? if erc_left_strength >= 30: The Left faction opposes this, and they are too strong at the moment.?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_resources += 1;
    Q.party_resources_mult += 1;
    Q.independence_trust -= 3;

    Q.erc_left_dissent += 5;
    Q.erc_core_dissent += 2;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_strength += 5;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_dissent -= 2;

    for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
        var delta_erc_young_support = Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] * 0.05;
        var delta_erc_ind_support = Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_ind_support"] * 0.05;
        var delta_erc_middle_support = Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_middle_support"] * 0.02;
        var delta_erc_unemployed_support = Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_unemployed_support"] * 0.05;

        if (Q.psc_recovery_factor <= 1){
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.5 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.4 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.5 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.4 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
        } else {
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.5 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.5 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.4 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_middle_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["middle"] });

            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.4 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_unemployed_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["unemployed"] });
        }        
    }
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.3, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "psoe", from: "erc", amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "bcomu", from: "erc", amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
!}

In times of economic uncertainty, it's never popular to increase public subsidies to political parties. Somehow, however, it is actually rather easy to have enough votes to have the measure approved.


@lower_allocation
title: Lobby for a reduction of party subsidies
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources_mult > 0 and erc_pragmatic_strength < 30 and party_resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if party_resources_mult <= 0: Party subsidies are already virtually non-existing. ?][? if erc_left_strength >= 30: The Pragmatics oppose this, and they are too strong at the moment. ?][? if party_resources < 1: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_resources -= 1;
    Q.party_resources_mult -= 1;

    Q.erc_left_dissent -= 8;
    Q.erc_core_dissent -= 4;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_dissent += 2;
    Q.erc_civic_dissent -= 4;

    for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "ciu", amount: 0.6, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["buss"] });
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "federal_left", amount: 0.3, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["buss"] });
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "psc", amount: 0.4, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["buss"] });
        G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "abstain", amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["buss"] });

        for (var demographic of ["middle", "ind"]) {
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "ciu", amount: 0.4, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: [demographic] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "federal_left", amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: [demographic] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "psc", amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: [demographic] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "erc", from: "abstain", amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: [demographic] });
        }
    }
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "erc", from: "ciu", amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "erc", from: "pp", amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "erc", from: "psoe", amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "erc", from: "ciu", amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "erc", from: "pp", amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "erc", from: "psc", amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
!}

Adding limits to public resources being given out to political parties is always welcome by most.


@raise_rates
title: Raise party dues
choose-if: party_income < 2
on-arrival: {!
    // TODO: Actually add the discounts on actions based on Q.party_income_increased (namely party additions to cards)
    Q.party_resources += 1;
    if (Q.party_income > 0) {
        if (Q.party_income_increased == 2) {
            Q.party_income += 1;
        } else {
            Q.party_income_increased = true;
        }
    } else {
        Q.party_income += 1;
    }
    Q.erc_left_dissent += 5;
    Q.erc_core_dissent += 5;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_strength += 5;

    for (var c of Q.parlament_constituencies) {
        var delta_erc_young_support = Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_young_support"] * 0.1;
        var delta_erc_ind_support = Q["erc_parlament_" + c + "_ind_support"] * 0.05;
        if (Q.psc_recovery_factor <= 1){
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.5 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.4 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.4 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
        } else {
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.5 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.3 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_young_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["young"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.1 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.2 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
            G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "parlament", to: "psc", from: "erc", amount: 0.5 * delta_erc_ind_support, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: [c], demographics: ["ind"] });
        }        
    }
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "abstain", from: "erc", amount: 0.2, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "congreso", to: "federal_left", from: "erc", amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5, constituencies: ["catalunya"] });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "bcomu", from: "erc", amount: 0.15, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
    G.cardSupportTransfer(Q, { contest: "barcelona", to: "cup", from: "erc", amount: 0.1, maxDonorFraction: 0.5 });
!}

Party dues have not really represented an important share of the party's income for a long time, so this is a somewhat unexpected decision. Our members grumble at this, specially the young, and some of the less committed members leave.  [? if party_income != 2: However, with this increased revenue, some actions that would have otherwise required investment will now be available without dedicated party resources. ?][? if party_income == 2: After repeated increases, nonetheless, we'll now enjoy more resources each year. ?]

@lower_rates
title: Lower party dues
subtitle: [? if party_income = 2: \[-1 resources\]?]
choose-if: party_income >= 1 and (party_resources > 0 or party_income < 2)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if party_income < 1: Dues are already as low as they can be. ?][? if party_resources < 1 and party_income == 2: Not enough resources. ?]
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.party_income == 2) {
        Q.party_income -= 1;
        Q.party_resources -= 1;
    } else if (Q.party_income > 0) {
        Q.party_income_increased = false;
    }
    Q.erc_left_dissent -= 7;
    Q.erc_core_dissent -= 7;
    Q.erc_pragmatic_dissent -= 4;
    Q.erc_civic_dissent -=5;
!}

While our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.
